  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca1.png\" alt=\"parca1\" width=\"24%\" />\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca2.png\" alt=\"parca2\" width=\"24%\" />\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca3.png\" alt=\"parca3\" width=\"24%\" />\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca4.png\" alt=\"parca4\" width=\"24%\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/readme.gif\" alt=\"alt text\" />\n</p>\n\n![alt text](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/image1.png)\n\n## 你想以其他語言閱讀本文嗎？\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/gb.svg\" alt=\"English\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/tr/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/tr.svg\" alt=\"Turkce\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/de/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/de.svg\" alt=\"Deutsch\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/es/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/es.svg\" alt=\"Espanol\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/fr/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/fr.svg\" alt=\"Francais\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/ja/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/jp.svg\" alt=\"Japanese\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/ko/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/kr.svg\" alt=\"Korean\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/pt-br/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/br.svg\" alt=\"Portuguese Brazil\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/ru/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/ru.svg\" alt=\"Russian\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/zh-cn/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/cn.svg\" alt=\"Chinese\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n\n# Safra 🚀\n\n別浪費時間處理伺服器設定或繁瑣的額外步驟  \n只需**兩下點擊**即可啟動你的 Minecraft 伺服器，直接進入遊戲\n\n✅ 無需複雜的介面 😌  \n✅ 沒有多餘的系統 🚫  \n✅ 輕量且經過優化 ⚡  \n\n![alt text](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/screenshot2.png)\n\n> 預覽畫面中使用的是 **TLauncher**（支援其他替代啟動器）  \n> 內建 **語音聊天** 支援（模組支援）\n\n## 模組支援\n\n你可以輕鬆與你和朋友安裝的模組一起遊玩  \n支援 **Fabric**、**Forge** 與 **NeoForge**\n\n## 注意事項 ⚠️\n\n> 若有使用 TLauncher 或其他啟動器的玩家要加入，只需由開啟伺服器的人將 `online-mode=false` 即可。\n\n![alt text](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/screenshot3.png)\n\n> 若希望生成的代碼保持固定，只需在設定中將 `Use Fixed Code` 設為 `on`。\n\n![alt text](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/screenshot8.png)\n\n## 常見問題 🤔\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/emoji1.png\" alt=\"faq emoji\" width=\"100%\" />\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"70%\" align=\"left\">\n      ✨ 需要新功能、有版本構想，或是發現了錯誤？<br />\n      你可以透過 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NHjBvRxDXP\">Discord</a> 與我們聯繫<br /><br />\n      ❤️ 開放原始碼專案位於此處<br />\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra\">DeveloperKubilay/Safra</a><br /><br />\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/how_it_works.md\">👀 想了解它是如何運作的？</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
